cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite this release as below."
type: R code
title: >-
  Data and R code for "Understanding the effects of electromagnetic fields
  on marine biodiversity at offshore wind farms: is scientific literature
  aligned with the needs?"
abstract: >-
  This release provides the dataset of 102 case studies extracted from
  18 research articles and the R code used to perform the analyses and
  produce the figures of the review article by Vogel et al. (submitted to
  Earth's Future). Data are released under a CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0 license and code
  under an MIT license.
